This repository is MZN Vagas, a desktop app (Electron + Express + React) that tracks job applications and simulates
interviews with the person's own AI. Read the root `AGENTS.md` before doing anything, and `docs/PLAN.md` for the plan.

Golden rules:

- personal data (CVs, salaries, recruiter messages, `workspace/`, PDFs, DOCXs) never goes into git, tests or logs;
- every file the app or the AI writes is validated by the zod schemas in `shared/`;
- `npm run verify` must pass before every commit.
